+=== content.javascript.log_message.excludes
+JavaScript messages to exclude from the qutebrowser UI.
+The dictionary keys are source glob patterns, and each value is a list of message glob patterns. A message matching both a source and a message pattern is not shown in the UI, even if its level is enabled by `content.javascript.log_message.levels`. Excluded messages are still logged according to `content.javascript.log`.
